<title>USA: EIA Weekly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</headline>
<text>
<p>U.S. PROPANE STOCKS (IN MILLION BARRELS)</p>
<p>		02/28/97    02/21/97   03/01/96   12/95  Change/Wk</p>
<p>East Coast	 3.6	 3.7	1.5	 3.4     - 0.1</p>
<p>Midwest	    9.4	 9.2	8.2	 17.3    + 0.1</p>
<p>Gulf Coast	10.5	11.7     10.3	 20.2    - 1.2</p>
<p>U.S. Total	24.3	25.5     20.7	 42.9    - 1.2</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Source: Estimates by U.S. Department of Energy's Energy</p>
<p>Information Administration. EIA will report propane stocks on</p>
<p>a weekly basis from October to May.</p>
<p>- Totals may not equal sum of regions due to rounding.</p>
</text>
